  "title": "Becki&#39;s Oven Barbecue Chicken",
  "description": "This popular appetizer features oven-baked chicken wings smothered with a traditional, home-made sauce of ketchup, Worcestershire, brown sugar and mustard.",
  "authors": [
    "ABBIECROMER"
  ],
